{
  "pid": "self-hard-02",
  "source": "selfmade",
  "difficulty": "hard",
  "title": "批次工艺阶段与运行时长统计（无外部时钟）",
  "requirements": "写一个功能块 FB，管理间歇反应釜批次。初始 (phase, elapsed, timeout)=(0,0,FALSE)。\n1. maxDuration 为正整数，单位为扫描拍；所有实数输入为有限值，不使用系统时钟或计时器。\n2. 每拍先记录 startBtn 上升沿，包括中止当拍；按 中止 > 新启动沿 > 运行计数 的优先级处理。\n3. abortBtn 为 TRUE 时立即进入 phase=9，elapsed 与 timeout 保持；同拍启动沿已消耗，重新启动必须松开再按。\n4. 无中止且出现新启动沿时进入 phase=1，elapsed=0、timeout=FALSE；启动拍不计数。\n5. 上一拍 phase 为1或2时先将 elapsed 加1。达到本拍 maxDuration 则 timeout=TRUE、phase=3，优先于升温达标；否则 phase=1 且 pv>=setpoint 时进入 phase=2。\n6. phase=3 为完成态、phase=9 为中止态，两态冻结计数及超时标志，直到新的有效启动或中止。不设无接口支持的操作员确认。",
  "variables": [
    {
      "name": "startBtn",
      "data_type": "BOOL",
      "description": "批次开始（上升沿有效）",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "abortBtn",
      "data_type": "BOOL",
      "description": "中止按钮（直接中止批次）",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "setpoint",
      "data_type": "REAL",
      "description": "工艺设定值",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "pv",
      "data_type": "REAL",
      "description": "过程测量值",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "maxDuration",
      "data_type": "INT",
      "description": "本拍超时门槛，正整数扫描拍数",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "elapsed",
      "data_type": "INT",
      "description": "本批次已计入的扫描拍数，启动拍为0",
      "direction": "output",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "phase",
      "data_type": "INT",
      "description": "阶段号：0=空闲 1=升温 2=保温 3=完成 9=已中止",
      "direction": "output",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "timeout",
      "data_type": "BOOL",
      "description": "超时标志",
      "direction": "output",
      "fields": []
    }
  ],
  "target_pou": "FUNCTION_BLOCK",
  "specs": [
    {
      "sid": "S1",
      "text": "无中止、无新启动沿且上一拍处于运行态时，恰好计数一拍（含完成拍）。",
      "ltl": "G((prev(TRUE) AND prev(phase=1 OR phase=2) AND NOT abortBtn AND NOT (startBtn AND NOT prev(startBtn))) -> elapsed=prev(elapsed)+1)",
      "kind": "sequencing",
      "verified_by": "bounded_checker"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S2",
      "text": "运行计数达到本拍正时限时进入超时完成态3。",
      "ltl": "G((prev(TRUE) AND prev(phase=1 OR phase=2) AND NOT abortBtn AND NOT (startBtn AND NOT prev(startBtn)) AND maxDuration<=prev(elapsed)+1) -> (timeout AND phase=3))",
      "kind": "safety",
      "verified_by": "bounded_checker"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S3",
      "text": "中止优先于同拍启动，并冻结计数与超时标志。",
      "ltl": "G(abortBtn -> (phase=9 AND elapsed=prev(elapsed) AND timeout=prev(timeout)))",
      "kind": "safety",
      "verified_by": "bounded_checker"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S4",
      "text": "完成和中止态在无新启动且无中止时保持。",
      "ltl": "G((prev(TRUE) AND prev(phase=3 OR phase=9) AND NOT abortBtn AND NOT (startBtn AND NOT prev(startBtn))) -> (phase=prev(phase) AND elapsed=prev(elapsed) AND timeout=prev(timeout)))",
      "kind": "safety",
      "verified_by": "bounded_checker"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S5",
      "text": "仅未中止的新启动沿开始批次并清零，启动拍不计数。",
      "ltl": "G(((startBtn AND NOT prev(startBtn)) AND NOT abortBtn) -> (elapsed=0 AND NOT timeout AND phase=1))",
      "kind": "sequencing",
      "verified_by": "bounded_checker"
    },
    {
      "sid": "N10-S1",
      "text": "11.10补充：本拍未中止且无启动沿时，若上一拍为运行态则累计拍数恰增 1，否则拍数保持；启动和中止分别按 S5、S3 处理。",
      "ltl": "G((!abortBtn AND !rising(startBtn)) -> ((prev((phase = 1) OR (phase = 2)) -> elapsed = prev(elapsed) + 1) AND (!prev((phase = 1) OR (phase = 2)) -> elapsed = prev(elapsed))))",
      "kind": "sequencing",
      "verified_by": "test_trace_audit"
    },
    {
      "sid": "N10-S2",
      "text": "11.10补充：本拍未中止且无新启动沿：上一拍为运行态时，以本拍累计拍数和门槛判超时，达到或超过即置位并进入完成态；上一拍不在运行态时保持超时标志。",
      "ltl": "G((!abortBtn AND !rising(startBtn)) -> ((prev((phase = 1) OR (phase = 2)) -> ((timeout <-> (elapsed >= maxDuration)) AND (timeout -> phase = 3))) AND (!prev((phase = 1) OR (phase = 2)) -> (timeout <-> prev(timeout)))))",
      "kind": "safety",
      "verified_by": "test_trace_audit"
    },
    {
      "sid": "N10-S3",
      "text": "11.10补充：中止命令有效即进入中止态，并保持上一拍的累计拍数及超时标志；与启动上升沿同拍仍以中止优先。",
      "ltl": "G(abortBtn -> (phase = 9 AND elapsed = prev(elapsed) AND (timeout <-> prev(timeout))))",
      "kind": "safety",
      "verified_by": "test_trace_audit"
    },
    {
      "sid": "N10-S4",
      "text": "11.10补充：无中止、无新启动沿时，上一拍非运行态保持原阶段。空闲保持 0，完成保持 3，中止保持 9；完成后若收到中止命令按 S3 转到 9，重新启动按 S5 处理。",
      "ltl": "G((!abortBtn AND !rising(startBtn) AND !prev((phase = 1) OR (phase = 2))) -> phase = prev(phase))",
      "kind": "safety",
      "verified_by": "test_trace_audit"
    },
    {
      "sid": "N10-S5",
      "text": "11.10补充：没有中止命令时，启动上升沿开始新批次并清零计数及超时标志；中止优先。",
      "ltl": "G((rising(startBtn) AND NOT abortBtn) -> (elapsed = 0 AND NOT timeout AND phase = 1))",
      "kind": "sequencing",
      "verified_by": "test_trace_audit"
    },
    {
      "sid": "N10-S6",
      "text": "11.10补充：运行计数拍若尚未超时，升温阶段在 pv 达到或超过设定值时进入保温，否则继续升温；保温阶段始终维持到超时、中止或新启动。",
      "ltl": "G((!abortBtn AND !rising(startBtn) AND prev((phase = 1) OR (phase = 2)) AND elapsed < maxDuration) -> (((prev(phase = 2) OR pv >= setpoint) -> phase = 2) AND ((prev(phase = 1) AND pv < setpoint) -> phase = 1)))",
      "kind": "sequencing",
      "verified_by": "test_trace_audit"
    }
  ],
